1
00:00:00,820 --> 00:00:28,620
People in the United States who are struggling to survive, who are having their black and brown babies chased and killed by police officers or kidnapped by ICE, people who are facing homelessness, those who are having to choose whether to pay medical bills, student loans, or rent, people who are overworked and underpaid do not need any foreign government or entity to tell them that this capitalist system is killing us.

2
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:31,620
We feel it in our bones and we feel it in our bodies every day.

3
00:00:32,020 --> 00:00:44,480
The Trump administration is persecuting people and organizations for promoting critical thought, for raising questions, and exposing the very criminal nature of this administration and the billionaires that it serves.

4
00:00:44,940 --> 00:00:54,620
On July 20th, the State Department released Cuba, the capital of 21st century communism, a report that is both ridiculous and dangerous.

5
00:00:54,620 --> 00:00:57,420
Its vagueness is the point.

6
00:00:57,920 --> 00:01:04,820
It doesn't share any real or clear definition of the threat, which means anyone can be targeted.

7
00:01:05,340 --> 00:01:06,600
And this is political warfare.

8
00:01:06,840 --> 00:01:07,940
It's a clear warning.

9
00:01:08,800 --> 00:01:12,740
You stand behind the racist attacks against immigrants and black communities.

10
00:01:13,240 --> 00:01:21,420
You support and cheer on the wars, the genocide, the blockades, or you are a communist, an enemy of the state.

11
00:01:21,420 --> 00:01:35,900
On July 24th, the House Ways and Means Committee issued subpoenas to the People's Forum, an educational and cultural organization advocating for the transformation of this ruthless system.

12
00:01:36,340 --> 00:01:50,060
They've subpoenaed Breakthrough News, an independent media outlet uplifting people's struggles from across the world, and Tri-Continental Institute for Social Research, a research institute that serves the people.

13
00:01:50,060 --> 00:01:53,200
This is a witch hunt, and no one, no one is safe.

14
00:01:53,540 --> 00:01:54,380
So let's be clear.

15
00:01:54,680 --> 00:02:04,020
They use Cuba to build a dangerous narrative, but these attacks on Cuba aren't only about Cuba and the continued genocidal policy against the Cuban people.

16
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:08,140
They're about dismantling movements right here at home.

17
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:17,080
They want to destroy organizations fighting for workers, for women, for trans people, for immigrants, and against the attacks on black America.

18
00:02:17,080 --> 00:02:20,060
Why? Because they are terrified.

19
00:02:20,700 --> 00:02:23,820
People are fed up, and people are organizing across struggles.

20
00:02:24,320 --> 00:02:29,220
And we have to be clear, this is not a time to let fear consume us.

21
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:33,600
This is a time for clarity, for denunciation, and collective struggle.

22
00:02:34,400 --> 00:02:44,280
History, not far from us or far away lands, but right here, show us that an authoritarian government who fears people power,

23
00:02:44,280 --> 00:02:49,680
start by attacking communists and radicals, but they always come for everyone.

24
00:02:50,020 --> 00:02:51,180
So no one is safe.

25
00:02:51,660 --> 00:02:55,740
When it comes to Cuba, we have to remain steadfast in our humanity.

26
00:02:56,240 --> 00:03:04,320
You don't have to be a socialist or a communist to oppose the U.S. blockade on Cuba and feel moved to show solidarity.

27
00:03:04,780 --> 00:03:07,400
You just have to be a decent human being.

28
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:15,680
No conscious person enjoys knowing that 11 million people are living in the dark because the wealthiest country in the world,

29
00:03:15,820 --> 00:03:20,660
the United States, has decided that this is the fate of other human beings.

30
00:03:21,240 --> 00:03:30,660
100,000 people, 12,000 of them, children waiting for surgeries because one nation decided on collective punishment

31
00:03:30,660 --> 00:03:34,000
because they consider Cuba's political ideology a threat.

32
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:37,580
Cuba does not need charity.

33
00:03:37,760 --> 00:03:40,160
Cuba needs an end to the blockade.

34
00:03:40,620 --> 00:03:41,860
Cuba is not a threat.

35
00:03:42,540 --> 00:03:45,460
The U.S. blockade on Cuba is a threat to human life.

36
00:03:46,240 --> 00:03:52,640
Please remember the Red Scare crushed movements, and it resulted in fearful conformity,

37
00:03:53,140 --> 00:03:56,760
a vacuum of independent organizations of our people.

38
00:03:57,260 --> 00:04:00,140
We cannot allow for this to happen again.

39
00:04:00,440 --> 00:04:02,720
We have advanced too much in our struggles.

40
00:04:02,720 --> 00:04:05,060
We won't be dragged back.

41
00:04:05,560 --> 00:04:07,480
We will not be demobilized.

42
00:04:07,620 --> 00:04:09,040
We will not be silenced.

43
00:04:09,500 --> 00:04:11,100
Solidarity is not a crime.

44
00:04:11,300 --> 00:04:12,200
It is our duty.

45
00:04:12,780 --> 00:04:17,340
The people organizing, mobilizing, and demanding what we rightfully deserve

46
00:04:17,340 --> 00:04:21,000
and advancing our struggles against capitalism is not a crime.

47
00:04:21,400 --> 00:04:22,360
It is our right.

48
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:32,060
So keep solidarity, keep mobilizing, keep organizing, and keep defending our very right to free speech.

